 "about_text": "Perrotin is an international contemporary art gallery founded in Paris in 1990 by Emmanuel Perrotin, then twenty-one years old. Over three decades the gallery has expanded to more than a dozen spaces across Europe, Asia and the United States, including Los Angeles. Its program is deliberately eclectic, spanning painting, sculpture, ceramics and new media, and bringing together long-represented artists alongside younger and emerging figures and several estates. The roster reflects a wide range of nationalities and generations, and the gallery is known for pairing gallery exhibitions with off-site museum projects, editions, a podcast, and public events.",
